WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.459 --> 00:00:02.336 line:0%
-Do you believe in the Chosen One?
-Yes!

00:00:06.131 --> 00:00:08.759 line:0%
<i>-Where is the next vaccination?</i>
-Aguazul.

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:10.552 line:0%
Any reports of contamination there?

00:00:11.136 --> 00:00:13.180 line:0%
<i>We've been trying to contact
the local doctor for days,</i>

00:00:13.263 --> 00:00:14.515 line:0%
<i>but we got nothing so far.</i>

00:00:14.598 --> 00:00:17.267 line:0%
<i>-As if it was a ghost village.
-Weird.</i>

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:24.483 line:0%
Sir, please...

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:27.569 line:0%
MEDICINE BRINGS DEATH

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:30.239 line:0%
WHAT IS ZIKA VIRUS MUTATION?
WARNING - DEADLY DISEASE

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:40.040 line:0%
You are making a mistake.
No one gets sick here, Doctor.

00:00:40.123 --> 00:00:43.544 line:0%
This is a mandatory vaccination
imposed by the government.

00:00:43.627 --> 00:00:45.712 line:0%
<i>Aren't you interested in a place
where nobody dies?</i>

00:00:45.796 --> 00:00:48.590 line:0%
<i>That crazy woman said a Chosen One
told them to attack us.</i>

00:00:48.674 --> 00:00:50.634 line:0%
You mentioned his name, Zulmira.

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:53.929 line:0%
<i>You said "Chosen One" in front
of a group of strangers.</i>

00:00:54.012 --> 00:00:56.139 line:0%
Blessed be the Chosen One.

00:00:56.223 --> 00:00:57.641 line:0%
Blessed may he be.

00:00:57.724 --> 00:00:59.518 line:0%
Blessed may he be.

00:00:59.601 --> 00:01:01.311 line:0%
Blessed may he be.

00:01:01.979 --> 00:01:03.230 line:0%
What's going on here?

00:01:05.357 --> 00:01:06.191 line:0%
I will investigate here.

00:01:11.613 --> 00:01:13.532 line:0%
They came to make us sick, Mateus.

00:01:14.408 --> 00:01:15.534 line:0%
They are going to kill us.

00:01:16.373 --> 00:01:17.536 line:0%
I warned you so many times.

00:01:18.579 --> 00:01:20.247 line:0%
What am I missing here?

00:01:28.297 --> 00:01:29.756 line:0%
That's our difference.

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:31.633 line:0%
Science is always in doubt.

00:01:31.717 --> 00:01:32.718 line:0%
Faith is certain.

